Cognitive tool prompts
----------------------
src/cogtools/tools/prompts.py contains prompt text adapted from:

  B. Ebouky, A. Bartezzaghi, M. Rigotti. "Eliciting Reasoning in Language
  Models with Cognitive Tools." arXiv:2506.12115, 2025.
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.12115
  Licensed under CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Taken verbatim from the paper: the cognitive-tools system prompt and the
prompts for understand_question, recall_related, examine_answer,
backtracking and use_code.

Changed: typographic quotes and apostrophes were converted to ASCII; stray
Python string delimiters left in the paper's copy were removed; inline math
that the arXiv HTML conversion dropped from the recall_related prompt was
reconstructed and is marked in the source. The tool signature text and the
message that carries tool inputs are not published in the paper and were
written for this repository.

